It has been reported that managing phone calls while driving is complex and leads to vehicle dynamic variations due to changes in vehicle dynamics due to the intricate nature of searching phone numbers and dialing a number. Participants reported that the common reasons behind the complexity of making phone calls are small buttons, small interfaces, and complex navigational patterns. The results are summarized and depicted in Figure 3 .
